  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ncr 581.05 Previous Offenses. If a person has not committed the same offense in 7 years, the next offense shall be considered as a first offense.\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5801.05), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
